  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising sovereign spreads raise borrowing costs and force near‑term fiscal consolidation in EU governments, prompting cuts or postponement of extra‑regional naval deployments and exercises that reduce European naval presence and readiness in the Gulf.</data>
