  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in European GDP growth momentum raises transport and industrial diesel demand, reducing supply surplus and thereby decreasing the diesel_supply_gap within a few months.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">european_institutional_f</data>
