  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained slowdown in European GDP growth lowers demand for imports and dampens export volumes, reducing commercial traffic and cargo volumes transiting the Gulf chokepoint.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">european_institutional_f</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_standoff</data>
